# Fresnel: no environment variables are read yet.
# Secrets are referenced through SOPS (see docs/xeon L0/secrets); never put values here.

# Desktop shell (apps/desktop-shell). Dev/test only; a packaged app reads it too.
# FRESNEL_DESKTOP_USER_DATA=/absolute/path   gathers the shell config dir, Electron userData and app logs under
#   <path>/config, <path>/electron, <path>/logs instead of ~/Library (a relative path is ignored). The engine's own
#   data dir is separate: FRESNEL_HOME. The engine's tools see HOME as the shell's HOME, so set both for a throwaway run.
